{"title":"The Scriptorium Apprentice","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">The Wizard keeps a lectern in his tower and nobody to work it.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/osric-blane\">Osric Blane</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"osric-blane\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Skill unlocks</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Unlocks</td><td>The <a href=\"#/guide/herblore\">Herblore</a> skill</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/warp-binxonia-mage-tower\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/bb534cb1d520e762f130.svg\" alt=\"\">Warp Binxonia Mage Tower</a> <b>×3</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/osric-blane\">Osric Blane</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Binxonia)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"osric-blane\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Scribe 3 Binxonia Mage Tower warps at the lectern and bring them to the Wizard. <span class=\"muted\">(3)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/warp-binxonia-mage-tower\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/bb534cb1d520e762f130.svg\" alt=\"\">Warp Binxonia Mage Tower</a> <span class=\"muted\">at -29, 24</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-29|24|Scribe 3 Binxonia Mage Tower warps at the lectern and bring them to the Wizard.\">Show on map</button></li></ol><p class=\"g-note\">Some steps in between were not recorded.</p></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>250</td></tr><tr><td>Herblore XP</td><td>1,610</td></tr><tr><td>Scribing XP</td><td>1,610</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Items</td><td><a href=\"#/item/herbalist-sickle\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/81bb78c688076788bbf9.svg\" alt=\"\">Herbalist Sickle</a><br><a href=\"#/item/woad-leaves\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/2b531ee5e0345b9213ca.svg\" alt=\"\">Woad Leaves</a> ×10<br><a href=\"#/item/woad-pigment\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/b8b7bc21f9a226e5e8e7.svg\" alt=\"\">Woad Pigment</a> ×9<br><a href=\"#/item/flax-fiber\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/344357a5592ac28ec79f.svg\" alt=\"\">Flax Fiber</a> ×50<br><a href=\"#/item/scribing-quill\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/f88baa0a6be3e420daab.svg\" alt=\"\">Scribing Quill</a><br><a href=\"#/item/parchment\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/70f48aa35bee0e56fc9a.svg\" alt=\"\">Parchment</a> ×6<br><a href=\"#/item/gem-amber\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\">Gem Amber</a><br><a href=\"#/item/warp-binxonia-mage-tower\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/bb534cb1d520e762f130.svg\" alt=\"\">Warp Binxonia Mage Tower</a> ×3</td></tr><tr><td>Unlocks</td><td>the <a href=\"#/guide/herblore\">Herblore</a> skill</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>The Scriptorium Apprentice</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-scriptorium-apprentice\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-scriptorium-apprentice\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-scriptorium-apprentice\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-scriptorium-apprentice\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}